    "title": "AG Files Lawsuit Against Regional Contractor - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tyler Friel ,\n1 days ago Pennsylvania’s highest law enforcement officer has sued a regional contractor for failing to complete work after receiving payment. Attorney General Dave Sunday has filed a lawsuit against A&S Contracting and Roofing along with owner Stephen Spallone for alleged violations of Pennsylvania Home Improvement Consumer Protection Act (HICPA) and Consumer Protection Law. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
